  "description": "When what feeds you is the burn in your lungs, the pump in your legs, and the speed of your descent, choose the Haro FL16 Carbon 27.5 frame, equipped with lightweight SRAM X01 drivetrain and Guide RS disc brakes, RockShox Reba RL fork and a Ritchey WCS cockpit. Engineered for a ride seasoned with quick power outbursts, agile turns, and a lower center of gravity, the Flightline Carbon Pro 27.5\" is the Haro of choice for racers who excel on every part of the trail.\nHaro FL Carbon 27.5 Series w/ tapered head tube, BB92 shell, 12mm rear thru-axle\nRockShox Reba RL 27.5 tapered fork, 100mm travel w/ 15mm thru-axle & Onelock remote lockout\nRitchey WCS Logic Zero Drop-In headset, tapered 1-1/8\"-1.5\", w/ ACB sealed bearings\nSram X01 32t crankset w/ Press Fit Sram GXP BB92 set\nSram X01 rear derailleur\nSram XG 1175 10-42T cassette & X01 Trigger 11-speed shifter\nRitchey WCS Flat handlebar, WCS stem and Lock-On grips\nRitchey WCS Streem V3 saddle & Ritchey WCS 27.2mm post\nSram Roam 30 lightweight wheelset for 15mm front & 12mm rear thru-axles\nKenda Honey Badger XC 27.5*2.05\" 120TPI folding tires\nSram Guide RS 180 / 160mm disc brakeset",
